],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report an actual obstacle using these five direct fields. Countercheck the alleged implication against the complete definitions, quantifiers and inequality directions; a feasible example alone does not determine an extremum. A fact not yet proved or registered in the current draft is an obligation to complete, not by itself a gap. For a mathematical stop, identify the concrete implication and actual mathematical difficulty encountered during normal checking/completion, not merely unfilled inventory or exposition. No fixed time/attempt count or counterexample is required. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP/SUSPECTED_GAP stop for an actual supported mathematical obstruction; INPUT_CONFLICT stops for incompatible inputs. In NL0, use source retrieval and explicit conditional deferral for unavailable primary texts; MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT requires that no complete secondary statement can be obtained. Other stages may report SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE for an actual access obstacle. Ordinary unfinished work is not an obstacle report. No mathematical acceptance is generated.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["SUBSTANTIVE_GAP","SUSPECTED_GAP","SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE","MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT","INPUT_CONFLICT"]},"location":{"type":"string"},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"basis":{"type":"string"},"partial_progress":{"type":"string"}},"required":["status","location","explanation","basis","partial_progress"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalPrope